From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UniFrog Maintainers <unifrog@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 05:29:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the UniFrog SF2000 Atari800 library port

Device-specific changes are maintained as a focused patch over the original upstream pin. Vendored libretro-common and unrelated platform assets remain owned by upstream.
---
